{"a":[112,112],"h":"<p>112.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 33.7 40.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> dedi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 159.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 39.7 39.7 47.3 54.0 54.0 69.7 69.7 78.7 78.7 90.7 90.7 102.7 118.6 118.6 118.6 135.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0 135.0 143.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbım! Hakk ile hukmünü ver - adaletin gecirgemesin<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 27.0 36.0 36.0 48.0 48.0 55.4 63.0 78.7 85.4 92.3 92.3 92.3 99.0 107.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"48.0 78.7 99.0 107.3 115.4\" y=\"21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Rabbımız o Rahmandır ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"204\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 203.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 56.3 63.0 69.7 85.6 96.7 96.7 103.6 121.6 121.6 132.0 138.7 145.6 152.3 164.3 164.3 173.3 173.3 180.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 56.3 69.7 103.6 138.7 145.6 152.3 187.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> isnad ettiğiniz vasıflarınıza karşı müsteandır - ey zalimler! Sihirdir, edgasü ahlâmdır, iftiradır, şiırdır gibi isnadlarınıza, dini islâm ve müslimîn aleyhindeki küfriyyatınıza karşı avn-ü nusrati matlûb olan ancak odur. </p>"}